-### Responsive images
-
-For an image that is content rather than a background, use `srcSet` and `sizes` when multiple local resolutions exist:
-
-```tsx
-<img
-  src={image}
-  srcSet={`${smallImage} 640w, ${largeImage} 1280w`}
