-
-Choose the repeat mode deliberately:
-
-```css
-/* Tile in both directions. */
-background-repeat: repeat;
-
-/* A horizontal strip. */
-background-repeat: repeat-x;
-
-/* A vertical strip. */
-background-repeat: repeat-y;
-
